# Live databases. storage/ (or the DATA_DIR / UPLOADS_DIR / TRANSLATIONS_DIR
# configured in .env) is written by the admin panel and by form submissions on
# the server; it must never be overwritten by a git pull. The versioned seeds
# in data/ and public/uploads/ are only read when a live file does not exist.
/storage/
# Submitted binary documents can contain CVs, invoices or identity data.
data/applications/

